              "type": "control",
              "questionOptions": {
                "rendering": "markdown"
              },
              "id": "dischargeTreatmentSignsOfInfection",
              "value": "2d. If there are any signs of infection like redness, discharges, foul odor, and pain, visit your attending physician or nearest hospital/clinic immediately.  "
